{
  "about": "What the fake answers on each canonical check of checks/airwallex_live.py, every key and status of it seen on the sandbox. Sandbox run 4 (2026-10-27, api_version 2024-09-27, Mode B, connected accounts off): sandbox 14/14, fake 14/14, and the fake's only extra keys were trace_id on the conversion replay and created_at, global_account_id, request_id on the deposit create; both were removed from the fake. A key added to the fake goes in here only after a --require-key run shows it on the sandbox. The connected probe is recorded, not diffed, and one-movement reads no answer of its own.",
  "api_version": "2024-09-27",
  "verified_on": "2026-10-27",
  "mode": "B",
  "checks": {
    "login": {"http": 201, "status": null,
              "keys": ["expires_at", "token"]},
    "balances": {"http": 200, "status": null,
                 "keys": ["available_amount", "currency", "pending_amount", "reserved_amount",
                          "total_amount"]},
    "global-accounts": {"http": 200, "status": "ACTIVE",
                        "keys": ["id", "required_features", "status", "supported_features"]},
    "fx-quote": {"http": 200, "status": null,
